%% Diagram: Architecture Decision Record lifecycle — from problem identification through options analysis and peer review to a versioned, searchable decision log
flowchart TD
    A["Architecture\nChallenge"]:::geon-primary --> B["Context &\nConstraints"]:::geon-highlight
    B --> C["Options\nAnalysis"]:::geon-accent
    C --> D["ADR\nDocument"]:::geon-accent
    D -->|"team review"| E{"Accepted?"}:::geon-outline
    E -->|"Yes"| F["Archived\nin Repository"]:::geon-primary
    E -->|"No"| C
    F --> G["Implementation\nTracking"]:::geon-highlight
    G -->|"superseded?"| A
